@startuml
scale max 2800 width
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

title Sequence Diagram 3.3.1 - PDF Upload, Hybrid PDFBox/Tess4J OCR & Async RAG Vector Indexing

actor "Content Admin / Teacher" as Admin
participant "PdfExtractionController /\nDocumentFileController" as Ctrl
participant "PdfExtractionServiceImpl" as PdfSvc
participant "OcrServiceImpl\n(Tess4J Vietnamese)" as OcrSvc
participant "DocumentContentServiceImpl" as DocSvc
participant "AiServiceClient" as AiClient
participant "Python FastAPI AI\n(/v1/chat/process-document)" as FastAPI
database "Supabase PgVector\n(vector_chunk)" as VecDB

Admin -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/documents/pdf/extract (MultipartFile PDF)
Ctrl -> PdfSvc : extractTextFromPdf(file)
PdfSvc -> PdfSvc : Classify PDF via PdfTypeClassifier (Apache PDFBox 3.0.1)
alt Digital Text PDF (Selectable Text >= Threshold)
    PdfSvc -> PdfSvc : Extract text directly via PDFTextStripper
else Scanned Image PDF
    PdfSvc -> OcrSvc : extractTextViaOcr(renderedPageImages, lang="vie")
    OcrSvc --> PdfSvc : OCR Extracted Vietnamese Text
end
PdfSvc --> Ctrl : PdfExtractionResponse (extractedText, pageCount, pdfType)

Admin -> Ctrl : POST /api/v1/documents (title, entityId, entityType, content)
Ctrl -> DocSvc : saveDocumentAndTriggerRag(request)
DocSvc -> DocSvc : Save Document entity (status = ACTIVE) in PostgreSQL
DocSvc -> AiClient : processDocument(docId, entityId, content)
AiClient -> FastAPI : POST /v1/chat/process-document (X-Internal-Api-Key)
FastAPI -> FastAPI : Delete existing chunks for docId
FastAPI -> FastAPI : _semantic_chunking(content) via BGE-M3 sentence cosine distances
FastAPI -> FastAPI : Generate 768-D embeddings concurrently (Semaphore=15) via Ollama bge-m3
FastAPI -> VecDB : Batch INSERT INTO vector_chunk (100 records/batch)
FastAPI --> AiClient : 200 OK (Indexed chunks count)
AiClient --> Ctrl : Completed
Ctrl --> Admin : 201 Created (DocumentFileResponse)
@enduml
